      {
        "name": "complete_membership_checkout",
        "title": "Complete membership checkout",
        "description": "Recovery tool: finish a membership signup from its Stripe checkout session id (cs_...). Creates the Stripe subscription if missing, writes the membership row, generates lesson occurrences, and sends the welcome message. Safe to re-run — it is idempotent. Requires confirm=true.",
